WEBVTT

01:30.620 --> 01:34.910
[The Unclouded Soul]

01:35.130 --> 01:37.729
[Episode 13]

01:56.479 --> 01:58.950
This flower sea
has been the final resting place

01:58.950 --> 02:02.350
for women of the Realm of Mist and Void
for thousands of years.

02:04.400 --> 02:07.200
You and I will eventually
become part of this soil.

02:08.680 --> 02:11.090
It's just a matter of sooner or later.

02:27.130 --> 02:28.300
Watering like this,

02:28.320 --> 02:30.150
when will I ever finish?

02:32.190 --> 02:34.210
It's like a bottomless pit.

02:35.870 --> 02:37.470
Today is the day of the trial.

02:37.800 --> 02:39.630
Why are you still here watering flowers?

02:39.630 --> 02:40.480
I didn't know.

02:40.500 --> 02:41.340
No one told me.

02:44.579 --> 02:46.980
How dare they defy
Immortal Lord's wishes?

02:46.990 --> 02:47.870
Come with me.

02:52.270 --> 02:57.150
[Harmony of the Five Flavors]

02:55.470 --> 02:57.040
What are all these?

02:57.079 --> 02:57.960
What are these things?

02:57.960 --> 02:59.490
They don't even look tasty.

02:59.560 --> 03:00.400
How can anyone swallow these?

03:00.400 --> 03:01.240
Follow me.

03:05.630 --> 03:06.680
I can't eat these.

03:07.470 --> 03:08.670
So many ingredients.

03:09.000 --> 03:11.910
Could it be that Immortal Lord
is preparing a welcome feast for us?

03:11.910 --> 03:13.640
These dishes are too ordinary.

03:13.680 --> 03:15.470
Not as exquisite
as what my family's cook prepares.

03:15.470 --> 03:16.280
Indeed.

03:16.360 --> 03:18.690
You young ladies from official families,

03:19.030 --> 03:20.700
fed with the finest delicacies
since childhood,

03:20.700 --> 03:22.120
yet all talk and no skill.

03:24.030 --> 03:26.030
I explained to everyone yesterday.

03:26.470 --> 03:28.470
The immortal realm protects women,

03:28.590 --> 03:31.720
but it's not a place
where you get something for nothing.

03:40.410 --> 03:41.590
Before you arrived,

03:41.810 --> 03:43.110
the women in the immortal realm

03:43.110 --> 03:45.300
had all experienced abandonment

03:45.960 --> 03:47.870
or suffered abuse in the human realm.

03:47.870 --> 03:49.670
Immortal Lord is kind-hearted,

03:49.710 --> 03:51.440
so she allowed them all to stay.

03:52.470 --> 03:55.530
They all managed households
to some extent in the past,

03:56.079 --> 03:58.140
so they're quite skilled in cooking.

03:58.710 --> 04:00.040
The only difference is,

04:00.280 --> 04:02.280
they did it for unworthy men before,

04:02.840 --> 04:03.470
but now,

04:03.920 --> 04:05.580
they do it all for themselves.

04:08.060 --> 04:10.260
Today's trial is cooking.

04:11.360 --> 04:13.020
If you don't put in the effort,

04:13.430 --> 04:15.160
you won't have a chance to stay.

04:15.240 --> 04:16.510
But at home,

04:16.510 --> 04:18.480
our parents never taught us how to cook.

04:18.480 --> 04:19.440
That's right.

04:19.600 --> 04:20.510
Cooking?

04:21.040 --> 04:22.310
Isn't that what servants do?

04:22.310 --> 04:22.750
Exactly.

04:22.750 --> 04:23.510
That's right.

04:23.510 --> 04:25.770
Then you'll have to fend for yourselves.

04:26.260 --> 04:27.700
If you really can't cook,

04:28.320 --> 04:29.810
you can give up now.

04:31.600 --> 04:32.400
We're doomed.

04:32.560 --> 04:33.740
This has just begun,

04:33.870 --> 04:35.030
and you're out.

04:35.950 --> 04:36.750
What's wrong with you?

04:36.750 --> 04:39.070
Don't get discouraged before I even start.

04:39.070 --> 04:40.130
It's true, though.

04:40.360 --> 04:41.240
You only know how to eat,

04:41.240 --> 04:41.920
not how to cook.

04:41.920 --> 04:42.720
You talk too much.

04:42.720 --> 04:43.190
We'll find out

04:43.190 --> 04:44.409
once I try.

04:48.230 --> 04:49.870
I mean everyone should do their best.

04:49.870 --> 04:52.400
If you don't know how,
you'll learn by trying.

04:53.430 --> 04:54.390
Easier said than done.

04:54.390 --> 04:55.010
Exactly.

04:56.409 --> 04:57.250
What if

04:57.950 --> 04:59.550
we fail to pass the trial?

05:00.000 --> 05:01.060
What happens then?

05:01.390 --> 05:02.630
If you fail,

05:03.140 --> 05:04.670
you'll find out naturally.

05:08.720 --> 05:10.720
Now, I'll announce the trial rules.

05:11.120 --> 05:11.630
First,

05:12.160 --> 05:14.960
everyone must announce
the dish they want to make.

05:15.240 --> 05:16.270
Once a dish is claimed,

05:16.270 --> 05:18.120
others can't repeat it.

05:18.830 --> 05:20.550
Second, as you can all see,

05:21.390 --> 05:23.720
all ingredients are already on the table.

05:23.980 --> 05:26.160
Those who announce their dishes first
get to choose first.

05:26.160 --> 05:27.620
First come, first served.

05:28.000 --> 05:30.130
When the measuring scale fully rises,

05:30.830 --> 05:31.920
those who haven't completed their dishes

05:31.920 --> 05:33.720
or have failed during the process

05:33.720 --> 05:35.050
will all be eliminated.

05:35.870 --> 05:38.070
Dishes completed within the time limit

05:38.510 --> 05:40.370
will be judged by Linghua Palace.

05:40.750 --> 05:42.210
Now announce your dishes.

05:42.220 --> 05:43.350
One dish per person,

05:43.360 --> 05:44.680
no repetitions allowed.

05:44.680 --> 05:47.610
-I'll make flower pastry.
-I'll make flower pastry.

05:55.440 --> 05:57.340
Dali, it's really delicious.

05:57.680 --> 05:58.780
It smells wonderful.

05:58.780 --> 05:59.630
This is Xiao Yao's flower pastry

05:59.630 --> 06:01.820
made with withered petals.

06:03.270 --> 06:04.270
How does it taste?

06:04.480 --> 06:05.120
Delicious.

06:05.120 --> 06:05.750
Tasty.

06:08.110 --> 06:09.120
Ms. Fairy,

06:09.120 --> 06:10.190
I said it first

06:10.190 --> 06:11.480
just now.

06:12.630 --> 06:13.360
I heard you.

06:13.850 --> 06:15.000
You said it first.

06:16.120 --> 06:17.000
Go get your ingredients.

06:17.000 --> 06:17.510
Okay.

06:24.310 --> 06:25.270
Ms. Fairy,

06:25.270 --> 06:27.480
I need osmanthus sugar, black sesame,

06:27.480 --> 06:28.810
and some flower petals.

06:29.270 --> 06:30.360
Take them yourself.

06:30.360 --> 06:30.960
Thank you.

06:31.730 --> 06:32.630
Next.

06:33.240 --> 06:34.700
I want to make Egg Custard.

06:39.600 --> 06:41.930
I want to make Scrambled Eggs with Shrimp.

06:44.190 --> 06:46.120
I'm sorry. I accidentally spilled the egg.

06:46.120 --> 06:47.240
Please forgive me.

06:49.640 --> 06:50.400
Go away.

06:52.210 --> 06:55.010
I want to make
Braised Chicken with Bamboo Shoots.

06:55.710 --> 06:56.570
That's enough.

06:58.159 --> 07:00.170
If you leave others with no way out,

07:00.930 --> 07:02.630
you're also heading
toward your own destruction.

07:02.630 --> 07:03.240
Go away.

07:03.600 --> 07:04.200
Yes.

07:08.920 --> 07:11.120
I was the first
to claim the Sweet and Sour Carp.

07:11.120 --> 07:11.870
Everything is mine!

07:11.870 --> 07:13.800
Can't you let me have this for once?

07:14.720 --> 07:15.310
What are you doing?

07:15.310 --> 07:16.310
Our fathers have the same official rank.

07:16.310 --> 07:17.190
Why should I give it to you?

07:17.190 --> 07:18.390
I got to choose first!

07:18.430 --> 07:19.040
You're being unreasonable!

07:19.040 --> 07:20.840
Ms. Fairy, can I make fried rice?

07:21.560 --> 07:23.120
Pei, I want to make stir-fried cabbage.

07:23.120 --> 07:23.750
Vinegar cabbage.

07:23.750 --> 07:24.920
You've killed this fish!

07:24.920 --> 07:26.160
You were the one
who pressed too hard first!

07:26.160 --> 07:27.480
This is my cabbage!

07:28.360 --> 07:30.310
This is mine! Give it to me!

07:30.410 --> 07:31.430
I got it first!

07:34.240 --> 07:35.810
Give me back my cabbage!

07:38.720 --> 07:40.850
Everyone, go to your assigned stoves.

07:42.260 --> 07:43.720
If you use the wrong stove,

07:44.060 --> 07:45.990
the credit will go to someone else.

07:49.830 --> 07:51.760
You, have you decided what to make?

07:53.560 --> 07:54.270
I...

07:55.390 --> 07:57.390
Topping Noodles. Topping Noodles.

08:00.430 --> 08:01.920
I don't know how to make it.

08:02.430 --> 08:03.360
I do.

08:03.830 --> 08:04.890
Hurry up and say it,

08:04.950 --> 08:06.280
or we'll be eliminated.

08:07.830 --> 08:09.360
I'll make Topping Noodles.

08:10.510 --> 08:11.120
Eel.

08:11.510 --> 08:12.560
I need eel.

08:13.270 --> 08:14.070
Fresh shrimp.

08:14.270 --> 08:15.070
Fresh shrimp.

08:15.480 --> 08:16.160
And flour.

08:16.400 --> 08:17.180
And flour.

08:18.270 --> 08:19.310
You're lucky.

08:19.310 --> 08:21.600
We have all the ingredients you asked for.

08:21.600 --> 08:22.420
Good, good.

08:24.590 --> 08:26.810
[Kitchen B Stove 2] [Kitchen B Stove 1]

08:26.830 --> 08:28.870
[Kitchen C Stove 1] [Kitchen C Stove 2]

08:29.240 --> 08:30.190
Switch stoves with me,

08:30.190 --> 08:32.390
and I'll give you a gold bracelet later.

08:37.120 --> 08:38.030
You know, without ginger,

08:38.030 --> 08:40.030
it just won't have the right flavor.

08:40.270 --> 08:42.000
Meat tastes better. I'll make a meat dish.

08:42.000 --> 08:44.260
Should I stir-fry everything together?

09:00.870 --> 09:02.010
Don't blame me.

09:02.670 --> 09:03.670
Don't blame me.

09:35.390 --> 09:36.360
You...

10:12.550 --> 10:14.010
A bunch of useless people.

10:14.420 --> 10:15.840
Get out of here, all of you!

10:15.840 --> 10:16.910
Next batch!

10:20.810 --> 10:23.550
[Kitchen B Stove 3]

10:40.440 --> 10:41.500
What are you doing?

10:44.910 --> 10:46.000
If you dare ruin my dish,

10:46.000 --> 10:47.330
I'll never forgive you.

10:49.240 --> 10:51.100
-What are you doing?
-Don't move.

11:05.270 --> 11:06.530
I will definitely win.

11:07.320 --> 11:08.600
I must stay here.

11:11.080 --> 11:11.750
So,

11:12.910 --> 11:15.440
you're willing
to throw away our friendship?

11:19.630 --> 11:21.480
You say we're friends,

11:23.040 --> 11:24.030
but we have never

11:24.030 --> 11:25.360
been treated as equals.

11:27.000 --> 11:28.860
After you came to Demons' Valley,

11:29.120 --> 11:30.240
in just a few days,

11:31.120 --> 11:33.320
you made all the minor demons adore you.

11:33.480 --> 11:34.480
Even His Lordship

11:35.120 --> 11:37.320
has opened his heart to you completely.

11:37.320 --> 11:38.030
But me?

11:39.310 --> 11:42.770
As a peony that should have reigned
supreme among all flowers,

11:43.070 --> 11:44.870
I've never been seen by anyone.

11:49.150 --> 11:51.200
You call me and Luoluo your friends,

11:52.750 --> 11:54.720
only because we're not as clever as you,

11:54.720 --> 11:55.920
not as cunning as you.

11:56.870 --> 11:57.930
Does our existence

11:59.570 --> 12:01.790
serve only to satisfy
your sense of superiority?

12:01.790 --> 12:02.600
Why?

12:03.750 --> 12:05.750
Why do humans and demons pamper you?

12:06.360 --> 12:08.410
Why can everyone only see you?

12:12.910 --> 12:14.440
We're not friends anymore.

12:18.390 --> 12:21.480
Immortal Lord only likes flowers
without green leaves.

12:21.480 --> 12:22.270
So do I.

12:23.890 --> 12:25.750
No one is willing to be just a leaf.

12:46.750 --> 12:47.400
Xiao Yao,

12:47.630 --> 12:49.430
no time for sentimentality now.

12:49.750 --> 12:52.480
I have Hong Ye's memories
of learning to make Topping Noodles.

12:52.480 --> 12:54.740
Open your eyes wide and watch carefully.

12:56.440 --> 12:57.320
Are you ready?

12:57.750 --> 12:59.080
I'm ready. What's next?

12:59.480 --> 13:00.280
Slice the eel.

13:00.550 --> 13:01.360
The eel.

13:03.480 --> 13:04.320
How do I cut it?

13:05.480 --> 13:06.540
Hold down the head.

13:08.390 --> 13:09.920
Put it on the cutting board.

13:11.270 --> 13:12.000
Use the knife

13:12.750 --> 13:13.750
to split its body.

13:16.790 --> 13:17.390
Like this.

13:20.600 --> 13:22.100
Use a smaller one.

13:32.790 --> 13:33.440
And then?

13:34.000 --> 13:34.670
Slice it up.

13:38.720 --> 13:40.080
Good. That's enough.

13:40.550 --> 13:41.630
Heat the wok and add oil.

13:41.630 --> 13:42.960
Heat the wok and add oil.

13:43.120 --> 13:43.510
Oil.

13:53.720 --> 13:54.800
Coat the eel in batter.

13:54.800 --> 13:56.500
What does that mean?

13:57.480 --> 13:58.810
It means putting the eel

13:59.000 --> 14:00.030
into the batter.

14:01.200 --> 14:01.790
Eel.

14:05.750 --> 14:06.270
Batter.

14:07.910 --> 14:09.640
Add some batter.

14:10.200 --> 14:11.480
Add some water.

14:13.320 --> 14:15.400
Too much water. Add more batter.

14:22.150 --> 14:23.550
If you don't add the eel soon,

14:23.550 --> 14:24.550
the wok will burn.

14:24.920 --> 14:26.250
Right away. Right away.

14:33.240 --> 14:35.480
Fry the eel
until the batter forms a crust.

14:35.480 --> 14:37.540
Crust? What does that mean?

14:37.630 --> 14:38.830
It means it gets hard.

14:39.240 --> 14:41.170
When it hardens, that's the crust.

14:42.270 --> 14:43.240
It's hardened now.

14:43.240 --> 14:43.910
What next?

14:43.910 --> 14:44.750
Take it out.

14:51.750 --> 14:53.440
It actually looks pretty good.

14:53.440 --> 14:55.200
Are the side ingredients ready?

14:55.200 --> 14:56.000
Shrimp.

14:57.270 --> 14:58.440
Only shrimp?

15:00.880 --> 15:01.910
No green onions?

15:06.130 --> 15:08.160
Put in the eel and shrimp.

15:15.660 --> 15:17.230
When do I add this ginger?

15:20.480 --> 15:21.440
Did you forget?

15:23.000 --> 15:24.060
Well...

15:27.270 --> 15:28.150
It's up to you.

15:28.390 --> 15:29.240
Then I will

15:29.480 --> 15:30.320
add 2 pieces.

15:31.240 --> 15:32.430
Is the sauce ready?

15:33.600 --> 15:34.530
Coming right up.

15:35.440 --> 15:36.550
Sauce.

15:37.440 --> 15:38.700
Who are you talking to?

15:49.870 --> 15:53.150
Soy sauce, cooking wine.

15:54.320 --> 15:55.850
Two spoonfuls.

15:58.840 --> 15:59.630
Sugar.

16:00.510 --> 16:01.600
Pepper.

16:02.270 --> 16:03.080
Salt.

16:06.030 --> 16:07.360
The wok is about to burn.

16:08.030 --> 16:09.890
Don't rush me. Coming right away.

16:21.030 --> 16:21.550
Water.

16:22.320 --> 16:24.250
Don't add water! It will splatter!

16:26.720 --> 16:28.450
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

16:37.750 --> 16:40.080
What should we do, Little Leaf?

16:41.360 --> 16:43.080
Even if Hong Ye were here,

16:43.630 --> 16:44.830
he couldn't help now.

16:47.550 --> 16:48.630
I have an idea.

16:50.080 --> 16:50.870
What idea?

16:53.320 --> 16:54.920
I'll make them

16:55.480 --> 16:56.790
something different.

17:00.550 --> 17:01.270
Here's a bracelet.

17:01.270 --> 17:03.130
Please, let's switch our dishes.

17:11.829 --> 17:12.720
Time's up.

17:16.440 --> 17:18.560
My hands are burning red!

17:18.920 --> 17:19.589
Stop now.

17:29.830 --> 17:31.550
Such humble food.

17:32.110 --> 17:34.170
I can't believe you came up with this.

17:34.510 --> 17:35.510
Immortal masters

17:35.510 --> 17:37.160
are used to all kinds of delicacies.

17:37.160 --> 17:40.490
But ordinary people
often have only a bowl of plain noodles.

17:40.790 --> 17:42.070
Immortal Lord has great compassion

17:42.070 --> 17:45.160
and created the Realm of Mist and Void
for suffering women.

17:45.160 --> 17:47.030
Surely she's always cherished a heart
that stands for equality for all,

17:47.030 --> 17:48.610
frugality in governance,
and love for the people.

17:48.610 --> 17:49.720
And this bowl of noodles

17:49.720 --> 17:51.200
is exactly what you would find

17:51.200 --> 17:52.730
on every commoner's table.

17:54.550 --> 17:55.680
Sharp-tongued.

18:00.200 --> 18:02.400
Let's see if that silver tongue of yours

18:03.200 --> 18:05.200
can really save your life.

18:07.370 --> 18:11.090
[Harmony of the Five Flavors]

18:13.440 --> 18:15.110
The tasting results are out.

18:15.920 --> 18:17.650
Those whose dishes are called,

18:17.830 --> 18:19.030
please step forward.

18:21.510 --> 18:22.370
Flower pastry.

18:25.440 --> 18:26.310
Cherry Pork.

18:26.770 --> 18:29.940
[Harmony of the Five Flavors]

18:28.400 --> 18:29.730
Golden Jade Abundance.

18:31.440 --> 18:32.970
Flower-Cut Mandarin Fish.

18:35.000 --> 18:36.260
Phoenix-Tail Shrimp.

18:38.240 --> 18:39.240
Lotus Pod-Shaped Tofu.

18:38.500 --> 18:45.010
[Harmony of the Five Flavors]

18:41.270 --> 18:42.160
Guinea Fowl.

18:43.720 --> 18:46.250
Stewed Chicken with Bird-Shaped Dumplings.

18:46.310 --> 18:48.370
Shark's Fin with Scrambled Egg Yolk.

18:51.480 --> 18:52.540
Yangchun Noodles.

19:00.510 --> 19:01.270
All of you,

19:01.180 --> 19:02.830
[Harmony of the Five Flavors]

19:01.400 --> 19:03.000
follow me to Linghua Palace.

19:13.060 --> 19:13.750
Ms. Fairy,

19:13.750 --> 19:15.510
please give me one more chance.

19:15.510 --> 19:16.350
Ms. Fairy,

19:16.590 --> 19:18.160
I made Sweet and Sour Carp.

19:18.160 --> 19:20.110
Ms. Fairy, please take me in.

19:20.190 --> 19:22.830
I would die for Dreamshard Immortal.

19:22.830 --> 19:24.830
Are you that desperate
to stay in the Realm of Mist and Void?

19:24.830 --> 19:25.490
-Yes.
-Yes.

19:27.640 --> 19:30.640
But the Realm of Mist and Void
never keeps idle people.

19:30.650 --> 19:32.310
Since you're so eager to stay,

19:32.690 --> 19:35.150
I'll grant you the fate
of becoming flowers.

19:35.400 --> 19:36.220
Flowers?

19:36.270 --> 19:37.240
Women

19:38.050 --> 19:40.250
are meant to be cherished like flowers.

19:41.240 --> 19:43.360
Among today's dishes,

19:43.440 --> 19:45.640
the Yangchun Noodles
stand out as the best.

19:45.640 --> 19:46.750
Who made them?

19:49.240 --> 19:50.970
Who made the Yangchun Noodles?

19:54.070 --> 19:55.400
Step forward to answer.

20:01.270 --> 20:03.550
Immortal Lord, I made them.

20:05.400 --> 20:06.990
Where did you learn

20:07.440 --> 20:08.900
to make noodles like this?

20:09.640 --> 20:10.900
More than 10 years ago,

20:11.000 --> 20:12.480
my father suddenly fell very ill.

20:12.480 --> 20:13.920
He was bedridden for days.

20:13.920 --> 20:16.270
So I tried to cook like he usually did

20:16.290 --> 20:17.750
and made a bowl of noodles.

20:17.920 --> 20:19.340
He said wild green onions
enhance the flavor,

20:19.340 --> 20:21.550
so I sprinkled some in the noodles.

20:21.790 --> 20:22.880
After he finished eating,

20:22.880 --> 20:24.410
he was already much better.

20:24.790 --> 20:26.920
Years later, he would still say

20:27.000 --> 20:29.130
it was the best thing he had ever eaten,

20:29.270 --> 20:31.400
because it was filled with sincerity.

20:31.480 --> 20:32.240
Today,

20:32.240 --> 20:34.640
I bring the same sincerity
as I did back then

20:34.790 --> 20:36.790
to make this bowl of noodles for you.

20:37.200 --> 20:39.260
Not only are your noodles excellent,

20:39.720 --> 20:41.380
but you also tell a good story.

20:42.550 --> 20:44.040
No wonder Hong Ye

20:44.510 --> 20:46.160
cherishes you so much.

20:50.110 --> 20:52.170
Then who made these flower pastries?

20:56.830 --> 20:58.920
Immortal Lord, I made them.

20:59.680 --> 21:00.750
Flower Demon,

21:01.310 --> 21:03.110
I didn't expect you to have real skills.

21:03.110 --> 21:04.640
You weren't exaggerating.

21:04.780 --> 21:06.310
Thank you for your recognition.

21:06.310 --> 21:07.640
With your talents,

21:08.070 --> 21:11.000
you may continue to stay
in the Realm of Mist and Void.

21:11.400 --> 21:12.350
However,

21:12.350 --> 21:15.080
if you wish to cultivate
the art of eternal youth,

21:16.200 --> 21:18.200
you must undergo the next trial.

21:23.590 --> 21:24.310
Zhirui,

21:24.830 --> 21:26.430
take them downstairs first.

21:34.720 --> 21:36.110
For the next trial,

21:36.750 --> 21:38.950
you can devise something interesting.

21:43.200 --> 21:44.330
Yes, Immortal Lord.

21:52.960 --> 21:54.620
This Heart-Devouring Poison

21:55.350 --> 21:57.810
was refined
by Immortal Lord over 100 years.

21:59.160 --> 22:00.420
Be it humans or demons,

22:02.160 --> 22:03.400
within 7 days of being poisoned,

22:03.400 --> 22:06.200
all will lose their minds
and become like puppets.

22:08.000 --> 22:09.860
But you've endured it for a month.

22:11.030 --> 22:12.690
That's truly unprecedented.

22:18.680 --> 22:20.540
What's wrong with being a puppet?

22:22.200 --> 22:23.000
No heart,

22:24.270 --> 22:25.110
no pain.

22:26.750 --> 22:28.550
Fighting against Immortal Lord

22:30.590 --> 22:32.790
won't change the final outcome anyway.

22:34.920 --> 22:37.980
I once gathered all the fragments
of the Kunlun Mirror,

22:38.790 --> 22:40.400
but I gave them to humans,

22:40.790 --> 22:42.650
causing demons to be slaughtered

22:43.070 --> 22:45.200
and bringing calamity for centuries.

22:45.350 --> 22:47.160
I deserve this torment.

22:48.240 --> 22:50.400
But if you want me to abandon my mind

22:52.310 --> 22:54.270
and live without emotions or love,

22:55.440 --> 22:57.830
even if I'm shattered to pieces,

23:01.350 --> 23:03.000
I will never submit.

23:03.830 --> 23:06.630
You've lived in this world
for thousands of years.

23:07.790 --> 23:09.070
You should know
how fickle humans are

23:09.070 --> 23:11.270
and how unpredictable human nature is.

23:11.480 --> 23:12.510
Only by letting go of desires

23:12.510 --> 23:15.480
and focusing on cultivation
can you achieve true enlightenment.

23:15.480 --> 23:17.310
Yet you keep giving your
devoted heart to humans.

23:17.310 --> 23:19.710
Haven't you been betrayed enough already?

23:24.480 --> 23:26.240
If it's true love,

23:30.830 --> 23:32.400
it's worth starting over.

23:39.880 --> 23:40.920
I can see

23:43.350 --> 23:44.880
you truly care for Xiao Yao.

23:46.440 --> 23:48.300
But in this Realm of Mist and Void,

23:49.500 --> 23:51.830
you must do some things
for Immortal Lord,

23:52.750 --> 23:54.950
so that Xiao Yao can have an easier time.

23:56.160 --> 23:57.830
What do you want me to do?

24:00.790 --> 24:02.520
Immortal Lord's demonic power

24:02.830 --> 24:05.160
requires large amounts of human essence.

24:06.880 --> 24:07.960
You can help Immortal Lord

24:07.960 --> 24:09.960
by bringing more mortal women here.

24:10.480 --> 24:11.940
She would be pleased then.

24:13.830 --> 24:15.200
I promised Xiao Yao

24:17.750 --> 24:19.640
I wouldn't harm innocent people.

24:20.790 --> 24:21.880
Then do you know

24:23.400 --> 24:25.060
what humans are thinking,

24:25.680 --> 24:28.610
who are desperately seeking
the celestial mountain

24:29.310 --> 24:30.640
on the ships in this sea?

24:31.830 --> 24:33.490
Find the celestial mountain,

24:34.550 --> 24:36.080
drink from the Yuli Spring,

24:36.720 --> 24:39.120
and finally kill you
and your demon people.

24:39.640 --> 24:41.970
Their hearts have been consumed by greed.

24:42.480 --> 24:44.030
You can just let them
fulfill their dreams here.

24:44.030 --> 24:45.560
And what's wrong with that?

24:53.920 --> 24:55.310
You don't know, do you?

24:57.590 --> 24:59.920
The ones who led these people
into the Realm of Mist and Void

24:59.920 --> 25:01.070
were themselves.

25:02.150 --> 25:03.920
The reason Immortal Lord sets up

25:03.920 --> 25:05.680
trials in the Realm of Mist and Void

25:05.680 --> 25:07.920
is to give these humans

25:07.920 --> 25:09.180
a chance for survival.

25:09.350 --> 25:12.000
She hopes they can understand
the preciousness of life

25:12.000 --> 25:14.060
and no longer be controlled by greed.

25:15.160 --> 25:16.160
Unfortunately,

25:17.920 --> 25:19.750
they all chose to stay.

25:34.280 --> 25:35.510
I won't force you.

25:37.390 --> 25:38.850
If you change your mind,

25:40.790 --> 25:42.770
I'll open this dungeon barrier

25:43.440 --> 25:44.750
and let you out.

25:45.250 --> 25:47.080
So you can see those

25:47.270 --> 25:49.270
who are controlled by greed.

25:50.510 --> 25:53.000
But if they insist on coming here,

25:54.670 --> 25:56.110
I ask you

25:56.910 --> 25:58.170
to guide them a little.

26:14.240 --> 26:15.040
What's wrong?

26:15.070 --> 26:15.870
I'm freezing.

26:17.280 --> 26:18.540
I'm freezing to death.

26:19.760 --> 26:21.420
The sun is so bright right now.

26:21.590 --> 26:22.750
How can you be cold?

26:23.960 --> 26:24.690
I don't know.

26:24.850 --> 26:25.780
I just feel cold.

26:27.420 --> 26:30.270
Could Hong Ye be suffering
from extreme cold right now?

26:30.270 --> 26:31.440
How would I know?

26:46.310 --> 26:46.910
Come here.

26:48.830 --> 26:49.830
Let me warm you up.

26:59.790 --> 27:00.510
How's that?

27:04.240 --> 27:05.720
For plants,

27:05.720 --> 27:07.110
as long as their roots are healthy,

27:07.110 --> 27:08.160
they will be fine.

27:10.000 --> 27:11.490
You know quite a lot.

27:13.750 --> 27:15.480
Dali told me this before.

27:19.030 --> 27:20.720
May the heavens take pity on us

27:20.720 --> 27:23.910
and guide us
to find the celestial mountain!

27:24.640 --> 27:26.590
The heavens take pity on you?

27:27.590 --> 27:30.440
Your desires
will only harm you in the end.

27:35.590 --> 27:37.240
Get out of here now.

27:46.960 --> 27:47.880
Steady your minds!

27:47.880 --> 27:48.720
This is test

27:48.720 --> 27:49.830
from the immortal!

27:51.830 --> 27:53.030
Northeast position!

27:57.510 --> 27:59.640
We offer our sincerity to the vast sea!

28:00.270 --> 28:01.350
Immortal, please

28:01.680 --> 28:02.940
show us the direction!

28:12.880 --> 28:15.350
The celestial mountain
is not meant for mortal eyes.

28:15.350 --> 28:16.480
Our fellow disciple

28:16.480 --> 28:18.610
gave her life to help us on our journey.

28:18.640 --> 28:20.370
We can't let her life be in vain.

28:21.640 --> 28:22.960
For immortality,

28:23.880 --> 28:26.480
you would actually
sacrifice your companion.

28:28.660 --> 28:30.620
We beg you to show us the way!

28:31.200 --> 28:33.060
If you drink from the Yuli Spring,

28:34.570 --> 28:36.860
you will no longer have emotions

28:37.830 --> 28:39.560
and no longer have a true heart.

28:40.920 --> 28:42.270
Do you still want that?

28:42.550 --> 28:45.110
We offer our blood to the vast sea!

28:45.110 --> 28:47.550
We beg you to guide us to Penglang!

28:48.830 --> 28:50.200
If only one person

28:52.690 --> 28:55.550
can survive to follow me
to the celestial mountain,

28:56.510 --> 28:57.770
do you still want that?

29:27.140 --> 29:28.720
Your greed is bottomless.

29:29.160 --> 29:30.220
Stop it, all of you!

29:30.880 --> 29:33.490
Today, I will grant your wish.

29:50.680 --> 29:52.000
Why are you always so fresh and dewy

29:52.000 --> 29:53.600
without being watered?

29:56.680 --> 29:58.270
Where did you get the dew?

30:07.220 --> 30:09.280
This must be the celestial mountain.

30:09.680 --> 30:10.880
Celestial mountain.

30:13.590 --> 30:14.320
Yuli Spring.

30:14.830 --> 30:16.230
Where is the Yuli Spring?

30:17.480 --> 30:19.200
Thank you, Exalted Immortal,
for your favor.

30:19.200 --> 30:20.550
To reach the celestial mountain
in this lifetime,

30:20.550 --> 30:22.320
any suffering is worth it.

30:22.680 --> 30:24.010
You must be an immortal.

30:24.880 --> 30:26.030
But looking at you,

30:26.590 --> 30:29.190
you don't seem much different
from us mortals.

30:29.310 --> 30:30.480
Do not be disrespectful
to the immortal maiden.

30:30.480 --> 30:31.080
Yes.

30:33.030 --> 30:35.420
May I ask, where is the Yuli Spring?

30:36.750 --> 30:38.160
After you drink from the Yuli Spring,

30:38.160 --> 30:39.590
you will no longer have feelings

30:39.590 --> 30:40.680
or a true heart.

30:40.900 --> 30:42.160
Do you still want that?

30:43.090 --> 30:45.790
Why are you saying the same things
as the immortal we met earlier?

30:45.790 --> 30:47.270
For the sake of immortality,

30:47.270 --> 30:49.600
everything in the world can be abandoned.

30:49.750 --> 30:50.440
Yes.

30:50.440 --> 30:51.830
We hope you will help us.

30:53.160 --> 30:55.320
Which immortal did you just mention?

30:55.830 --> 30:57.360
He wore red and white robes,

30:57.680 --> 30:58.940
handsome and elegant,

30:59.110 --> 31:01.560
clearly someone from an immortal sect.

31:01.640 --> 31:03.240
Did he bring you here?

31:03.720 --> 31:04.450
Yes, indeed.

31:04.920 --> 31:05.650
Sect Leader.

31:05.920 --> 31:07.250
Look at her attire.

31:07.400 --> 31:09.000
She's just a servant at most.

31:09.030 --> 31:10.490
It's pointless to ask her.

31:12.070 --> 31:13.800
The true immortals are coming!

31:15.320 --> 31:15.920
They are indeed immortals.

31:15.920 --> 31:17.050
They are immortals.

31:17.240 --> 31:17.900
Immortals!

31:18.000 --> 31:19.460
-Immortals!
-Immortals!

31:20.640 --> 31:22.790
Welcome everyone
to the Realm of Mist and Void.

31:22.790 --> 31:25.440
Is this Realm of Mist and Void
the same as Penglang?

31:25.440 --> 31:26.970
So you are immortal ladies?

31:27.720 --> 31:30.450
We are merely disciples
of Dreamshard Immortal.

31:31.110 --> 31:32.440
If you are fated to stay,

31:32.880 --> 31:35.280
we shall all address
each other as sisters.

31:35.350 --> 31:36.160
Sisters.

31:36.550 --> 31:37.310
Follow me.

31:38.960 --> 31:39.720
-Great.
-Let's go.

31:39.720 --> 31:40.120
Hurry.

31:40.160 --> 31:40.440
Go.

31:40.440 --> 31:40.750
Go.

31:41.200 --> 31:41.720
Go. Go.

31:42.070 --> 31:42.600
Let's go.

31:46.160 --> 31:47.310
This situation

31:48.550 --> 31:50.610
repeats in the Realm of Mist and Void.

31:51.960 --> 31:54.590
This place was once just
a small flower bed.

31:56.270 --> 31:57.160
But now,

31:57.960 --> 32:00.290
it has transformed into a vast flower sea.

32:01.680 --> 32:03.610
And within the roots of each flower

32:04.000 --> 32:06.200
lies buried the desires of each person.

32:06.590 --> 32:08.320
Generation after generation,

32:08.680 --> 32:10.280
they come one after another.

32:12.680 --> 32:13.750
You want to stop it,

32:15.550 --> 32:16.680
but are you capable?

32:35.100 --> 32:37.990
♪ A thousand years have flowed by ♪

32:39.320 --> 32:41.500
♪ Turning into tears
that brim over my eyes ♪

32:42.970 --> 32:45.230
♪ And the moonlight to heal sorrow ♪

32:43.960 --> 32:46.020
Demon King, you've already seen her.

32:46.360 --> 32:49.210
♪ The sweetness of the world
always tastes like the first time ♪

32:46.720 --> 32:47.980
Immortal Lord is kind.

32:48.960 --> 32:50.930
Xiao Yao is doing well
in the Realm of Mist and Void.

32:50.320 --> 32:53.310
♪ The joys and sorrows in my dreams ♪

32:51.160 --> 32:52.560
Please come back with me.

32:54.550 --> 32:56.910
♪ Transformed into a farewell song,
stirring the soul ♪

32:58.240 --> 33:00.590
♪ And into wind and rain,
drifting and swirling ♪

33:01.710 --> 33:03.960
♪ The ship of fate
always faces the waves ♪

33:05.230 --> 33:08.300
♪ From now on, someone will share
all my love and hatred ♪

33:09.300 --> 33:11.870
♪ Together, we explore
mountains and rivers with one heart ♪

33:12.660 --> 33:15.920
♪ From now on, someone will share
all my dreams and my drinks ♪

33:16.980 --> 33:19.060
♪ With an extra pair of eyes, we
admire the sun, moon, and stars together ♪

33:20.240 --> 33:23.590
♪ From now on, the moon fears waning,
the waves long for the returning tide ♪

33:24.490 --> 33:26.990
♪ I carry an extra touch of care
in my heart and on my brow ♪

33:27.720 --> 33:31.160
♪ From now on,
with reckless courage and mutual longing ♪

33:32.410 --> 33:37.990
♪ Giving up three lives of marriage
just for ♪

33:36.090 --> 33:37.470
[Lovely and intelligent]

33:37.110 --> 33:39.030
Xiao Yao performed excellently

33:39.510 --> 33:40.590
in her first trial.

33:41.440 --> 33:43.790
Immortal Lord
is quite impressed with her.

33:43.790 --> 33:45.400
If you stop being stubborn,

33:46.110 --> 33:48.910
she won't need to participate
in the second trial.

33:49.030 --> 33:50.590
She can accompany Immortal Lord

33:50.590 --> 33:52.350
and share immortality with her.

33:52.350 --> 33:53.750
This second trial

33:54.240 --> 33:56.170
is different from the previous one

33:56.440 --> 33:57.840
and much more dangerous.

34:03.720 --> 34:04.590
I know.

34:05.880 --> 34:08.469
You refuse to let the poison
control your mind

34:09.280 --> 34:11.320
because you still care for Xiao Yao.

34:11.800 --> 34:14.199
But if you insist on
defying Immortal Lord,

34:14.800 --> 34:17.260
causing her
to take her anger out on Xiao Yao,

34:18.070 --> 34:20.730
wouldn't that go against
your true intentions?

34:21.190 --> 34:22.760
Don't you want

34:23.150 --> 34:25.190
to protect the one you love?

34:26.760 --> 34:28.590
Right now, you can move freely,

34:29.840 --> 34:33.040
only because Immortal Lord
hasn't activated the poison.

34:33.590 --> 34:35.630
The agony of the poison

34:36.710 --> 34:38.590
is something
you've already experienced deeply.

34:38.590 --> 34:39.989
Why not join with Xiao Yao

34:41.630 --> 34:44.630
and willingly become part
of my Realm of Mist and Void?

34:45.280 --> 34:46.480
Let me go back.

34:56.320 --> 34:58.110
Hong Ye is truly stubborn.

34:59.150 --> 35:01.150
And Xiao Yao has such a sharp tongue.

35:02.230 --> 35:04.690
If they really stay
by Immortal Lord's side,

35:04.840 --> 35:06.640
it will be trouble for everyone.

35:07.230 --> 35:08.800
We might as well
take advantage of the trial

35:08.800 --> 35:10.200
and get rid of them early.

35:10.670 --> 35:12.130
You're telling me all this

35:12.840 --> 35:14.320
because you want me
to report to Immortal Lord?

35:14.320 --> 35:15.250
I wouldn't dare.

35:18.070 --> 35:20.400
But seeing how ambitious Xiao Yao is,

35:21.510 --> 35:23.510
aren't you afraid that if she stays,

35:23.960 --> 35:25.560
she'll usurp your position?

35:25.670 --> 35:26.320
Pei.

35:28.230 --> 35:29.550
Your tone now

35:29.550 --> 35:31.950
is becoming
more and more like Ying Ning's.

35:32.400 --> 35:34.000
Please don't talk nonsense.

35:34.280 --> 35:35.550
What I just said

35:36.230 --> 35:37.830
was for everyone's benefit.

35:38.550 --> 35:39.680
It was for yourself.

35:39.920 --> 35:40.920
That's the truth.

35:42.800 --> 35:44.550
Congratulations to you.

35:46.110 --> 35:47.840
What is there to congratulate?

35:50.440 --> 35:52.510
You've worked so hard
for the Realm of Mist and Void,

35:52.510 --> 35:54.440
and your loyalty
to Immortal Lord is evident.

35:54.440 --> 35:55.920
Immortal Lord is considerate

35:55.920 --> 35:58.780
and ordered me
to give this immortal dew balm to you.

36:04.230 --> 36:05.490
Apply it day and night,

36:05.510 --> 36:07.920
and the scars on your face will disappear.

36:16.150 --> 36:17.000
Then

36:17.550 --> 36:18.880
I must thank you, Zhirui.

36:18.880 --> 36:20.770
With Immortal Lord's immortal dew,

36:20.770 --> 36:23.100
your beauty will surpass what it once was.

36:25.280 --> 36:26.580
I will thank

36:26.710 --> 36:28.110
Immortal Lord in person.

36:41.070 --> 36:43.070
Immortal Lord
is protecting her so much.

36:43.070 --> 36:45.130
Won't she walk all over us from now on?

36:46.770 --> 36:47.970
We'll see about that.

37:08.280 --> 37:09.740
Are you angry with Hong Ye?

37:10.070 --> 37:11.380
He didn't talk to you today

37:11.380 --> 37:14.100
because Dreamshard's confidant
was right beside him.

37:14.100 --> 37:14.710
He did this

37:15.070 --> 37:16.070
to protect you.

37:20.840 --> 37:22.150
Can you sense

37:22.360 --> 37:24.090
what Hong Ye is doing right now?

37:25.030 --> 37:25.760
I don't know.

37:26.510 --> 37:27.840
Then what can you do?

37:29.280 --> 37:30.960
I can summon Hong Ye's true self

37:30.960 --> 37:32.420
to be with you for a moment.

37:34.110 --> 37:35.110
Don't believe me?

37:35.590 --> 37:38.450
But my spiritual power
can only sustain it briefly.

37:39.190 --> 37:40.480
His true form can't come here.

37:40.480 --> 37:42.940
Only his primordial spirit
can be summoned.

37:43.360 --> 37:44.360
Then cast your spell.

37:44.360 --> 37:45.690
Cast it now. Cast it now.

37:46.630 --> 37:47.630
Watch carefully.

38:00.360 --> 38:01.150
Xiao Yao.

38:07.760 --> 38:08.550
Hong Ye.

38:20.050 --> 38:21.380
I've disappointed you.

38:22.920 --> 38:24.580
This is my primordial spirit.

38:30.800 --> 38:31.800
Do you blame me?

38:33.550 --> 38:35.010
What would I blame you for?

38:35.990 --> 38:36.990
Should I blame you

38:37.320 --> 38:39.180
for leading humans to this island

38:39.550 --> 38:40.510
or blame you

38:42.880 --> 38:44.140
for looking so haggard

38:45.030 --> 38:47.710
for suffering the pain
of Heart-Devouring Poison alone?

38:47.710 --> 38:49.840
The poison hasn't been activated yet,

38:50.360 --> 38:51.420
so I'm fine for now.

38:52.630 --> 38:54.320
I didn't speak to you during the day,

38:54.320 --> 38:55.980
but that wasn't my intention.

38:56.710 --> 38:58.570
If I show you any extra attention,

38:58.810 --> 39:00.940
it gives them reason to cause trouble.

39:01.880 --> 39:04.010
I don't want you to be harmed in any way.

39:05.400 --> 39:06.630
Dreamshard Immortal

39:06.630 --> 39:09.280
keeps claiming
that human nature is greedy.

39:10.400 --> 39:11.610
I went to the sea

39:11.670 --> 39:13.840
to stop humans from coming to the island.

39:13.840 --> 39:15.970
But their obsession with immortality

39:16.400 --> 39:17.530
made them stubborn.

39:18.190 --> 39:19.790
I couldn't change anything.

39:21.440 --> 39:22.240
I understand.

39:24.360 --> 39:26.920
I understand you have many constraints.

39:28.840 --> 39:30.300
You've been through a lot.

39:43.230 --> 39:44.290
You spend your days

39:45.000 --> 39:46.860
watering flowers in this flower sea,

39:46.860 --> 39:48.590
working hard and getting tired.

39:48.590 --> 39:50.360
Though I can't always be with you,

39:50.360 --> 39:51.890
at least Little Leaf is here

39:52.030 --> 39:53.430
to take care of you for me,

39:53.600 --> 39:55.200
which gives me peace of mind.

40:04.400 --> 40:05.660
Stretch out your hand.

40:39.440 --> 40:40.510
The second trial

40:40.660 --> 40:42.060
is extremely dangerous.

40:42.440 --> 40:43.550
If you participate,

40:43.550 --> 40:45.410
you must be careful at every step.

40:53.710 --> 40:54.360
Hong Ye.

40:56.030 --> 40:56.760
Hong Ye!
